                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Far From Noise is what I would call a \"therapy game\". I mostly played... I dunno, almost a decade ago now. It was during a profoundly difficult point in my life, and I don't think I can say that a short game on Steam helped me through it, not exactly - but it did provide a few moments of peace and perspective in the middle of everything. Whether you need that or not, the game is quite beautiful in its own small way. I can't go back and play it again now, due to all the heavy associations it has for me personally, but I still wanted to give it a thumbs up for existing.",
